# 8. Time Complexity

| Operation                    | Time Complexity |
| ---------------------------- | --------------- |
| Traversal                    | O(N)            |
| Searching                    | O(N)            |
| Counting nodes               | O(N)            |
| Accessing a node by position | O(N)            |

Why?

Because in the worst case, we may need to visit **all N nodes**.

